          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "FLAMSTEAD             BEECHWOOD PARK TL 01 SW                                         (West side) 3/13                                   Gate, piers and steps -                                      at West gate to walled                                        garden at Beechwood Park                                        School GV                                     II Gate, piers and steps. Early C18. Wrought iron, red brick piers with stone copings, moulded stone steps. A single gate with iron standards and overthrow between 3M tall square red brick piers set in an older garden wall of same height. 2 stone steps lead down into garden on E. Gate has dog-bars in bottom panel, scrolled lock rail, twisted points above, rectangular standards spaced 1 bar from piers have elaborate scrolled infill and the tops range with the head of the gate. Scrolled finials above each standard and taller one over gate with a Chinese fret in centre. Listing NGR: TL0452514362"
    }
  ],
